        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin MIA-CRR, Miami Handleset with Contemporary Round Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Contemporary Miami Entrance Set has just enough of the art deco touch to make it very stylish. The stepped sides of the handleset make it a bold choice, a vintage classic brought into the modern day. The Miami Handleset is available in modern finishes--all of which have a 25 year manufacture's warranty. A grade 2 entryset, it will fit 1-3/4 inch thick doors up to 2-1/2 inches thick. It comes with an adjustable latch that is good for 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Miami Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits 2-1/8\" cross bore for both deadbolt and grip with a 1\" edge bore for both grip latch and deadbolt latch.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin C-Keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Latch: square corner adjustable</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Brass deadbolt features 1\" throw. Grip offers 1/2\" passage/privacy function bolt.</li>\r\n<li>Deadbolt tested to exceed ANSI-BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Collection 3/4 Escutcheon Miami Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Length: 18-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Plate Length: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Grip Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Deadbolt Diameter: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Single Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Double Cylinder Interior Deadbolt Projection: 3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Trim Rose Diameter: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Contemporary Miami Entrance Set with Round Rose, Baldwin MIA-CRR",
                "description": "Baldwin MIA-CRR, Contemporary Miami Entrance Set - The Contemporary Miami Entrance Set has just enough of the art deco touch to make it very stylish. The stepped sides of the handleset make it a bold choice, a vintage classic brought into the modern day. The Miami Handleset is available in satin nickel, polished chrome, and venetian bronze finishes--all of which have a 25 year manufacture's warranty. A grade 2 entryset, it will fit 1-3/4 inch thick doors up to 2-1/2 inches thick. It comes with an adjustable latch that is good for 2-3/8 inch backsets or 2-3/4 inch backsets. Choose from single cylinder, double cylinder, or dummy functions.",
                "keywords": "Contemporary entry sets, Contemporary handlesets, Modern front door entry sets, Modern entry sets, Modern handlesets, Modern front door entry sets, baldwin reserve collection entrance trim sets, grade 2 handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, dummy handlesets, Baldwin MIA-CRR, Contemporary Miami Entrance Sets, Baldwin Reserve Miami Entrysets, Contemporary Miami Entrance Set with Round Roses, Miami Handleset with Contemporary Round Roses, Baldwin Reserve Collection 3/4 Escutcheon Miami Handlesets,"
